:: Deadwood Reblooms Raven Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-raven-events'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') and maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.available and !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.met>>
    <<addinlineevent 'deadwood_raven_flock' 0.75>>
      <<set _raven to maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A low croak draws your attention to a cluster of black birds among the roots. One turns a scrap of glass in its beak, watching you with one dark eye.<br><br>
          You stop. The birds remain where they are. <span class='teal'>One hops a little closer.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一声低哑的鸣叫吸引了你的注意。几只黑鸟聚在树根之间，其中一只衔着玻璃碎片转了转，用一只黑眼睛看着你。<br><br>
          你停下脚步。鸟群没有飞走，<span class='teal'>其中一只往你这边跳近了些。</span>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<if _raven.canFeed>>
        <<foodstufficon _raven.food>><<lanLink ['Leave some fruit (0:05)', '留下一份水果 (0:05)']>>
          <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('feed') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<iconUi 'raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Follow the birds (0:15)', '跟随鸟群 (0:15)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('follow') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
      <<lanLink ['Keep walking', '继续前行'] 'Forest'>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</addinlineevent>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-raven-link'>>
  <<set _raven to maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Raven>>
  <<if _raven and _raven.available>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.shrine.stage is 0 and $MoreTransformations.shrine.feeds gte 3>>
      <<deadwood-raven-letter-link>>
    <<elseif _raven.met>>
      <<iconUi 'raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Look for the raven flock (0:05)', '寻找渡鸦群 (0:05)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('visit') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <<elseif _raven.canSearch>>
      <<iconUi 'raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Listen for the ravens (0:15)', '循着鸣叫寻找渡鸦 (0:15)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('search') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Raven
<<set _ravenReturn to ['Churchyard', 'Park', 'Deadwood Raven Shrine'].includes($MoreTransformations?.raven?.origin) ? $MoreTransformations.raven.origin : 'Forest'>>
<<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
  <<location 'churchyard'>>
<<elseif _ravenReturn is 'Park'>>
  <<location 'park'>>
<<elseif _ravenReturn is 'Deadwood Raven Shrine'>>
  <<set $location to 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<else>>
  <<location 'forest'>>
<</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<set _raven to maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Raven>>
<<if _raven and _raven.met>>
  <<switch $MoreTransformations.raven.action>>
    <<case 'search'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You stop to listen, following the low calls.
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            A raven watches from a worn stone arch. It drops to a headstone as you approach. Two more perch above it, their claws scraping the stone.
          <<else>>
            A raven hops between the roots beside the path. Two more settle on a low branch, watching as you approach.
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          One croaks, and you answer almost without thinking. The sound comes easily. You can still feel it in your throat when the birds fall quiet.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你停下来仔细聆听，循着低哑的鸣叫走去。
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            一只渡鸦从磨损的石拱上看着你。走近时，它落到一块墓碑上，另两只栖在上方，爪子擦过石面。
          <<else>>
            一只渡鸦在小径旁的树根间跳跃。另两只落在低处的枝条上，看着你走近。
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          其中一只叫了一声，你几乎不假思索地回应了它。声音自然地脱口而出。鸟群安静下来后，那股震颤仍留在你的喉咙里。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'follow'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The birds hop from branch to branch, leading you away from the path. A croak sounds just above your shoulder. You answer before you can think.<br><br>
          Your throat tightens. For a moment, you can pick out every rustle in the canopy. One bird gives a short, rasping call, and you know how to answer.<br><br>
          When you turn around, <span class='purple'>the path is farther away than you expected.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          鸟群在树枝间跳跃，带着你离开小径。一声鸣叫从你肩头上方传来。你还没想好，就已经回应了它。<br><br>
          你的喉咙发紧。有那么一瞬间，树冠里的每一声轻响都清晰可辨。一只鸟短促地叫了一声，你知道该怎么回应。<br><br>
          回过头时，<span class='purple'>小径比你想象中离得更远。</span>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'feed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            You leave the fruit on a low wall and step back. A raven takes a piece, then another joins it. Their beaks click against the stone.
          <<else>>
            You leave the fruit on a root and step back. A raven takes a piece, then another joins it. Their beaks click against the bark.
          <</if>><br><br>
          One looks up and croaks. An answering sound catches in your throat. You swallow, but the urge to answer stays with you.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            你把水果放在矮墙上，往后退了退。一只渡鸦啄走一块，另一只也凑了过来，鸟喙碰在石面上，发出轻响。
          <<else>>
            你把水果放在树根上，往后退了退。一只渡鸦啄走一块，另一只也凑了过来，鸟喙碰在树皮上，发出轻响。
          <</if>><br><br>
          其中一只抬头叫了一声。回应它的声音卡在你的喉咙里。你咽了咽口水，那股想要回应的冲动仍未消散。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'call'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You listen to the ravens, then try their calls for yourself.
          <<if $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 6>>
            Your voice carries. Several birds turn towards you, answering in quick succession.
          <<elseif $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 2>>
            You hear the small differences between their voices. One answers when you get its call right.
          <<else>>
            The sound comes out hoarse. A bird tilts its head and croaks again. You try once more.
          <</if>>
          Your throat feels tired by the time you stop.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你听着渡鸦的叫声，试着模仿。
          <<if $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 6>>
            你的声音传开，几只鸟转向你，接连回应。
          <<elseif $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 2>>
            你能听出它们声音里细微的差别。模仿对了时，其中一只回应了你。
          <<else>>
            发出的声音有些沙哑。一只鸟歪了歪头，又叫了一声。你再试了一次。
          <</if>>
          停下来时，你的喉咙已经有些累了。
      <</language>><<gtiredness>>
    <<case 'preen'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You sit in the shade, smoothing your dark feathers into place. A loose feather comes away between your fingers. Above you, a raven works its beak through its own plumage.<br><br>
          The remaining feathers settle neatly against your skin. You feel a little more at ease.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你坐在阴凉处，把黑色羽毛一根根理顺。一片松动的羽毛落在指间。头顶上，一只渡鸦正用鸟喙梳理自己的覆羽。<br><br>
          其余羽毛顺服地贴着皮肤，你也放松了些。
      <</language>><<lstress>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            You find the ravens on the old stonework. One hops along a wall as you approach, keeping you in view.
          <<else>>
            You find the ravens among the trees. One hops along a branch as you approach, keeping you in view.
          <</if>>
          <<if $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 4>>
            It settles beside you, close enough for its feathers to brush against yours.
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard'>>
            你在旧石墙上找到了渡鸦。走近时，一只鸟沿着墙头跳了几步，始终看着你。
          <<else>>
            你在林间找到了渡鸦。走近时，一只鸟沿着枝条跳了几步，始终看着你。
          <</if>>
          <<if $maplebirch.transformation.raven.level gte 4>>
            它在你身边停下，近得羽毛几乎碰到了你的覆羽。
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<if $MoreTransformations.shrine.stage is 0 and $MoreTransformations.raven.action is 'feed' and $MoreTransformations.shrine.feeds lt 3>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.shrine.feeds is 1>>
      <<lanSwitch 'The birds finish the fruit before you leave. One follows you for a few steps, then returns to the others.' '你还没离开，水果就被吃光了。一只渡鸦跟了你几步，又跳回同伴身边。'>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'One bird lands close enough to take the last piece. It lingers after the others have finished eating, tilting its head at you.' '一只渡鸦落到近处，啄走最后一块。其他鸟都吃完了，它还留在你身旁，歪着头打量你。'>>
    <</if>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _raven.available>>
    <<deadwood-raven-letter-link>>
    <<if _raven.canFeed>>
      <<foodstufficon _raven.food>><<lanLink ['Leave some fruit (0:05)', '留下一份水果 (0:05)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('feed') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if _raven.canCall>>
      <<icon 'sing.png'>><<lanLink ['Imitate the ravens (0:10)', '模仿渡鸦的叫声 (0:10)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('call') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if _raven.canPreen>>
      <<iconUi 'raven.png'>><<lanLink ['Preen your feathers (0:10)', '梳理覆羽 (0:10)']>>
        <<set _raven_origin to $passage>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations').Raven.act('preen') and $passage is _raven_origin>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Raven'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<transform-hint 'raven' 'grey'>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The birds have flown out of sight. You should head back.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        鸟群已经飞出了视野。你该回去了。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif _raven and $MoreTransformations.raven.action is 'search'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stop to listen. Wind stirs the leaves, but no raven answers. After a while, you turn back to the path. You can try again tomorrow.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你停下来仔细聆听。风吹动树叶，却没有渡鸦回应。过了一会儿，你转身回到小径。明天可以再来找找。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [_ravenReturn is 'Churchyard' ? 'Return to the churchyard' : _ravenReturn is 'Park' ? 'Return to the park' : _ravenReturn is 'Deadwood Raven Shrine' ? 'Return to the shrine' : 'Return to the path', _ravenReturn is 'Churchyard' ? '返回老教堂墓地' : _ravenReturn is 'Park' ? '返回公园' : _ravenReturn is 'Deadwood Raven Shrine' ? '返回神社' : '返回小径'] _ravenReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>>
